        <span itemprop="definition">may include a repeating unit having a structure other than propylene structure.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0091">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the upper limit of the amount of a repeating unit (excluding the propylene structure) from the comonomer</span>
