        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0098">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the upper limit of the density of the polyolefin (A)</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is preferably 1.1 g/cm 3 or less, 1.0 g/cm 3 or less, 0.98 g/cm 3 or less, 0.97 g/cm 3 or less, 0.96 g/cm 3 or less, 0.95 g/cm 3 or less, 0.94 g/cm 3 or less, 0.93 g/cm 3 or less, or 0.92 g/cm 3 or less.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0098">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the density of the polyolefin (A)</span>
